        "readOnlyHint": true,
        "title": "Inspect Page"
      },
      "description": "Outline the current page for writing a test: URL, title, ready state, headings, forms, iframes, shadow-DOM hosts, and every control with its role, accessible name, a selector that finds it, and whether it is visible and enabled. Bounded by limit; says when it was cut short.",
